# Coleção do fluxo completo (D-20): REST Client do VS Code ou HTTP Client do JetBrains.
# Pré-requisito: `docker compose up --build`. Os segredos são os valores locais do .env.example.
# Ordem: tokens → abrir carteira → BET → replay → rejeição → consultas → reconciliação.
# Para repetir o fluxo do zero, troque @playerId (a abertura é única por jogador e moeda) e os
# externalTransactionId/Idempotency-Key das operações.

@api = http://localhost:8081
@kc = http://localhost:8080/realms/pda/protocol/openid-connect/token
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1

### 1. Token do serviço interno (role wallet-internal)
# @name internalToken
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=wallet-service&client_secret=wallet-service-local-secret

### 2. Token do provedor A (role provider, provider_id=provider-a)
# @name providerToken
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=provider-a&client_secret=provider-a-local-secret

### 3. Abrir carteira com 100.00 BRL → 201 (repetir → 409 WALLET_ALREADY_EXISTS)
# @name wallet
POST {{api}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 4. BET de 80.00 → 200 PROCESSED, saldo 20.00
POST {{api}}/wagering/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 5. Replay da mesma BET → 200, idempotentReplay: true, saldo original 20.00
POST {{api}}/wagering/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 6. Segunda BET de 80.00 → 422 REJECTED / INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
# @name rejected
POST {{api}}/wagering/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-2

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-2",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 7. Mesma chave com outro conteúdo → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{api}}/wagering/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "1.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 8. Consultar a rejeição pelo id interno (provedor)
GET {{api}}/wagering/transactions/{{rejected.response.body.transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 9. Consultar pelo id externo
GET {{api}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-1
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 10. Carteira (interno)
GET {{api}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 11. Ledger (interno): abertura + débito, ordenados pela versão
GET {{api}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/ledger?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 12. Reconciliação (interno) → consistent: true, checkedEntries: 2
POST {{api}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken.response.body.access_token}}

### 13. Sem token → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{api}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}
